@host = http://localhost:5008
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. LOGIN (altijd eerst deze sturen!)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}

### 2. BUSINESSREGEL: uren op "Oude webshop" (Closed) -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/timeentries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "projectId": 3,
  "description": "Nog een bugfix",
  "hours": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 3. uren boeken op actief project -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/timeentries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "description": "Testen van de homepage",
  "hours": 2.5,
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 4. project bestaat niet -> 400
POST {{host}}/timeentries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "projectId": 999,
  "description": "Iets",
  "hours": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 5. ongeldige invoer (0 uren, lege omschrijving) -> 400
POST {{host}}/timeentries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "description": "",
  "hours": 0,
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 6. alle projecten (geen login nodig) -> 200
GET {{host}}/projects

### 7. één project met zijn uren -> 200
GET {{host}}/projects/1

### 8. project bestaat niet -> 404
GET {{host}}/projects/999

### 9. nieuw project ZONDER token -> 401
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mobiele app",
  "client": "Acme NV"
}

### 10. nieuw project MET token -> 201 (status automatisch Active)
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Mobiele app",
  "client": "Acme NV"
}

### 11. project afsluiten -> 204
PUT {{host}}/projects/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Mobiele app",
  "client": "Acme NV",
  "status": "Closed"
}

### 12. project verwijderen -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/projects/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. alle urenregistraties -> 200
GET {{host}}/timeentries

### 14. urenregistraties van project 1 -> 200
GET {{host}}/timeentries?projectId=1

### 15. registratie verwijderen -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/timeentries/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. nieuwe gebruiker registreren -> 200 (of 409 als hij al bestaat)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carlos",
  "password": "geheim123"
}
